msgctxt "140"
msgid "Waugh... *sniffle* My car..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "152"
msgid "Aaaaagh! I told you we oughta stop doing hit-and-stops..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "164"
msgid ""
"I've heard of guys who jump in front of cars, but actually trying to run "
"into people? And even demanding repair money?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "176"
msgid ""
"Well... people usually get intimidated by the luxury car, so nobody puts up "
"a fight... They usually just pay."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "188"
msgid ""
"You're actually the first person who hasn't paid us... What's your deal, "
"anyway?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "200"
msgid "I guess this just isn't your day."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "212"
msgid ""
"Okay... uh... we apologize. To make up for the trouble we caused, please "
"accept this."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "224"
msgid "You got <Color:8>50,000 yen<Color:Default>."
msgstr "Hai ottenuto <Color:8>50.000 yen<Color:Default>."

msgctxt "260"
msgid "Sure we shouldn't call a tow truck?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "284"
msgid "You got 3,000 EXP."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "344"
msgid "Aaaaagh! Who <Italic>are</Italic> you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "356"
msgid "I told you we oughta stop doing hit-and-stops..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "368"
msgid ""
"I've heard of guys who jump in front of cars, but actually trying to run "
"into people? And even demanding repair money?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "380"
msgid ""
"Well... people usually get intimidated by the luxury car, so nobody puts up "
"a fight... They usually just pay."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "392"
msgid ""
"You're actually the first person who hasn't paid us... What's your deal, "
"anyway?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "404"
msgid "I guess this just isn't your day."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "416"
msgid ""
"Okay... uh... we apologize. To make up for the trouble we caused, please "
"accept this."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "428"
msgid "You got <Color:8>30,000 yen<Color:Default>."
msgstr "Hai ottenuto <Color:8>30.000 yen<Color:Default>."

msgctxt "452"
msgid "You got 3,000 EXP."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "536"
msgid "Whoa⑬"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "608"
msgid "(That guy almost hit me!)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "620"
msgid ""
"Hey! The hell are you doing!? Did you guys see how he jumped in front of "
"me!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "632"
msgid ""
"Oh, no... Looks like you damaged the car.\r\n"
"You have any idea how much this car costs?\r\n"
"You better pay for this!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "644"
msgid "How could I have damaged your car if I didn't even touch it?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "656"
msgid ""
"Are you trying to be a wiseass now? You got any idea how much this car is "
"worth? It's gonna cost 500,000 yen just to fix this!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "668"
msgid ""
"Ugh, my neck's starting to hurt. I think I might have whiplash⑬I had to slam"
" on the brakes, thanks to him..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "680"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "692"
msgid ""
"Well, part of this was our fault. We could settle this for 100,000... or we "
"could go to the cops and you could pay for it all."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "704"
msgid "Fine. 100,000 yen, right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "728"
msgid ""
"Oh, good. You're gonna pay up? Smart move. Always better when we can settle "
"this the easy way."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "740"
msgid "You handed over <Color:8>100,000 yen<Color:Default>."
msgstr "Hai consegnato <Color:8>1.000 yen<Color:Default>."

msgctxt "752"
msgid ""
"One... two... three... That's ten bills.\r\n"
"Thanks."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "776"
msgid "You got 3,000 EXP."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "836"
msgid ""
"Oh, good. You're gonna pay up? Smart move. Always better when we can settle "
"this the easy way."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "848"
msgid ""
"One... two... three... huh?\r\n"
"This ain't enough."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "860"
msgid ""
"Here we are tryin' to solve this like gentlemen, and you pull this shit on "
"us!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "872"
msgid ""
"You think you can mess with us, pal!? Well, if you won't cough up the cash, "
"maybe we'll just beat it out of you!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "884"
msgid ""
"Why would I pay you? The car isn't damaged. And why should I believe you "
"have whiplash?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "896"
msgid ""
"What did you say!? I try and let you off easy, and this is how you treat "
"me!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "908"
msgid ""
"You've got guts, jerk. Well, if you won't cough up the cash, I'll just beat "
"it out of you!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "932"
msgid "Don't Pay"
msgstr "Non Pagare"

msgctxt "944"
msgid "Pay 100,000 Yen"
msgstr ""

